        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of elevated plasma BCAA levels plus either enzyme activity deficiency or pathogenic genetic variants",
    "notes": "Newborn screening and biochemical assays are critical for early diagnosis."
